cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Si usas esta herramienta o sus ideas, cítala así. / If you use this tool or its ideas, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Metacognition: Poliedro de observación / Observation polyhedron"
abstract: >-
  Interactive metacognition tool. The object of study sits inside a regular
  polyhedron whose faces are frames of observation: windows that each show
  only part of the object. Findings are pinned to the object; turning it
  brings one frame's findings in front of another frame's window, where they
  are re-read (confirmed, nuanced, contradicted or extended). Edges hold
  notes on the intersections between frames.
authors:
